<title>INDIA: India Glaxo, Burroughs interim.</title>
<headline>India Glaxo, Burroughs interim.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The boards of Glaxo India Ltd and Burroughs Wellcome India Ltd on Friday declared an interim dividend of 15 percent for the year ending December 31, 1996, Glaxo said in a statement.</p>
<p>It did not give details.</p>
<p>-- Bombay Newsroom +91-22-265-9000</p>
</text>
